==Battleground==
*70 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*10 [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[H. Nah]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Nothing special is necessary here as long as the lineup can deal with Master A and H. Nah.

